  "lineage": "Buddhist ritual wind-ensemble music of Beijing's Ming-dynasty Zhihua Temple, transmitted by monk-musicians in a lineage traced to the temple's founding and listed as national intangible heritage in 2006. Guanzi lead, with sheng, dizi and yunluo gong-chimes over drum and cymbals, playing suites from gongche-notated scores (the acoustic drum card stands in for the temple drum).",
